{"resourceIdentifier":"4548","resourceName":"Tech-Bank Animal Waste Management Systems (AWMS) GHG Mitigation Project in Chuzhou& Bengbu, Anhui","description":"Tech-Bank Animal Waste Management Systems (AWMS) GHG Mitigation Project in Bengbu, Anhui (hereafter referred to as “the project”) installs new animal waste management systems (AWMS) to treat the manure from 4 newly-built swine farms in Chuzhou City and 2 newly-bulit swine farms in Bengbu City, Anhui Province, respectively, which are owned by Tech-Bank Food Co., Ltd. Each subsidiary swine farm installs one AWMS, and the manure is treated on-site. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.In the project activity, all manure and wastewater are collected and then the next step will be solid-liquid separation. The solid manure is processed in an aerobic composting system and it is provided free of charge as raw material to the local third-party fertilizer company , which carrys it away regularly and processes it into organic fertilizer. The liquid is treated by covered anaerobic lagoons and biogas is produced during this treatment process , then the biogas is captured and sent to an on-site torch and destroyed. The 4 newly-built farms in Chuzhou City produce the biogas which is sent to the heat generation for AWMS using, and the surplus is sent to an on-site torch and destroyed. The 2 newly-built farms in Bengbu City produce the biogas which is sent to the power generator for AWMS using, and the surplus is sent to an on-site torch and destroyed. The detailed handling methods of the 5 sites see Section 3.3 - Project Boundary. The sludge produced from anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solid after fermentation is applied as fertilizer to fields, and the wastewater from the covered anaerobic lagoons is used for agricultural irrigation.","location":{"latitude":32.454579,"longitude":117.956117},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-04-13","endExclusive":"2025-05-14","endInclusive":"2025-05-13"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4548"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Anhui"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tech-Bank Food Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 181 0517 9175"},{"type":"string","value":"1090757710@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"124836"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"30/10/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2023 - 31/12/2032"}]}]},{"programCode":"SDVISTA","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Tech-Bank Food Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Anhui Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 181 0517 9175"},{"type":"string","value":"1090757710@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Undergoing validation and verification"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"124836"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livelihoods"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"FIRST_VERIFICATION_VER_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certifica